<title>INDIA: India TELCO 97/98 Q1 exports down 38 pct.</title>
<headline>India TELCO 97/98 Q1 exports down 38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exports of truck-maker Tata Engineering and Locomotive Company Ltd (TELCO) fell 38 percent in the first quarter of 1997/98 (April-March), chairman Ratan Tata told shareholders on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He did not give details immediately.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
